  "translation": "Ndipo anamutumizira uthenga kwa iye, nati: “Kodi ndi chiyani kwa ine ndi kwa iwe, mfumu ya Yehuda? Palibe pa iwe iwe lero, koma ku nyumba ya nkhondo yanga ndi kupita, ndipo Elohim anati ndithamange. Dzikhalire wekha kuletsa ndi Elohim amene ali ndi ine, kuti asakuwononge.”",
